<title>UK: Grand Met agrees to sell Pearle Vision.</title>
<headline>Grand Met agrees to sell Pearle Vision.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grand Metropolitan Plc on Wednesday said it agreed to sell its Pearle Vision retail eyewear chain to U.S.-based Cole National Corp for 140 milion stg.</p>
</text>
